"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 31.2px; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">신고 대상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">군제대 예비군 전원(2020학년도 1학기 복학생)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 31.2px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">신고 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">: 2020.1.28(</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">∼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">3.27(</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 31.2px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">신고 방법 : 원스톱서비스&nbsp;로그인 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">인터넷신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 15pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">[</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">홈페이지&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">원스톱서비스&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">학적&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">복학 신청시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">예비군 창에서&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">예</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">를 클릭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 13pt;\">후 본인의 병적사항을 입력하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">저장하면 예비군 대원 신고 완료&nbsp; (방문 필요없음)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 36px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.06px; font-size: 17.33px;\">※ 본인의 실수로 군번 등 예비군정보를 잘못 입력하게되면 학교소속으로 편성이 안 될 수도 있으니 반드시 (054-478-7159 로 전화하거나 D122 예비군연대로 방문하여야 함)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 31.2px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">기타 문의사항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">예비군 연대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">(054-478-7159) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 31.2px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 13pt;\">2020. 1.&nbsp;15</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬돋움; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" s